    <p data-i18n="faq1Body">The original counter used 183 days as a configurable starting point for residency exposure. It was a tracking aid, not a determination of tax residency.</p>
  </details>
  <details>
    <summary data-i18n="faq2Title">Can I still use the app or sign in?</summary>
    <p data-i18n="faq2Body">No. Nomad Counter is retired. Travel tracking, sign-in, account sync, and live statistics are no longer available. The account database has been deleted.</p>
  </details>
  <details>
    <summary data-i18n="faq3Title">What has been preserved?</summary>
    <p data-i18n="faq3Body">The original design, this project story, and the source code are preserved. Existing browser records are not read, changed, or uploaded by this showcase.</p>
  </details>
